# What is ignored here is narrow on purpose: only the files this repository
# GENERATES. Documents authored directly in Word -- the HAS, and each owner's
# block specification -- have no markdown source, so git is the only copy there
# is and they must be tracked.
#
#   authored in Word, TRACKED        QSOC_HAS_Report_*.docx, <Owner>_<Block>.docx
#   generated from doc/src/*.md      the five QNSC_*_MAS.docx below, IGNORED
#
# The five below are ignored rather than committed because they are build output:
# they are binary, so a review cannot read them, and they go stale the moment the
# markdown changes without a rebuild -- which reintroduces the source-versus-output
# drift this project is built to avoid. Run `python3 build_docs.py` to produce them.
#
# Listed by name rather than as /*.docx so that adding an authored document does
# not silently make it untracked.

# Build intermediate: the numbering-stripped reference document build_docs.py
# derives from the template on each run.
template/QNSC_Reference_NoAutoNum.docx

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
